    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61611" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάθρ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Man.
			6.207
		</span></i>:—later form of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαθραῖος, κλέμματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ichn.</u>
					66
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρετμοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.Com.
					3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθυμίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					535.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλάματα, εὐνά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Bion
				2.6
			</span></i>; of a person, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ οὔατα λάθριος εἶπεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Ap.</u>
					105
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. γαμέτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					336.5
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Troas</span>); of a place, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. νάπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					20.39
				</span></i>
			 codd. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λάτμιον</span> Wilamowitz):
			neut. pl. as Adv., <i>secretly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Del.</u>
				241
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάθρια μὲν γελάοισα</span>
			<i>treacherously</i> (
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάθρῃ</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				1.96
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λαθρίη, ἡ</span>, epith. of Aphrodite, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.300.1
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>).</div>
